WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.370
Cleaning parsing validation and verification are
different tasks Cleaning

00:00:06.397 --> 00:00:12.295
changes known formatting noise Parsing extracts
meaningful components

00:00:14.011 --> 00:00:19.541
Validation checks whether a value follows a rule
Verification

00:00:19.568 --> 00:00:25.172
asks whether the value corresponds to reality
Keeping these tasks

00:00:25.198 --> 00:00:29.001
separate makes a preparation pipeline easier to
reason about and audit
